</mxCell><mxCell id="t_hpp_kalkulasi" value="&lt;b&gt;hpp_kalkulasi&lt;/b&gt; (2.442 baris) [DUAL SOURCE]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sync Order:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;SELECT DISTINCT nama_prd FROM orders&lt;/code&gt; (Digit)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Upload Excel:&lt;/b&gt; Impor arsip HPP lama&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Input Riil:&lt;/b&gt; Staf mengisi nilai rupiah HPP per pesanan produksi" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=8;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;align=left;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d97706;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
